                "title": "Sion Lever with Disk Rose",
                "description": "The Sion Lever has a unique shape that makes it appear chunkier than most modern levers for transitional homes and those who want their door hardware to get noticed. The Contemporary Sion Leverset with Disk Rose is easy to install. It will fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick. Choose from a wide array of beautiful modern finishes. \r\n",
